tatic</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_always_unique<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_5\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_always_exhaustive<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (5) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_6\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_always_strided<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (6) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Every instance of every specialization of <code>mapping</code> is unique and strided.\n</p><p>The mapping is exhaustive if one of the following conditions is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rank_</span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>, or\n</li><li> there exists a permutation <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code> of the integers in the range <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rank_</span></code><code>)</code></span> such that:\n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stride<span class=\"br0\">(</span>p<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> equals <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> and\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stride<span class=\"br0\">(</span>p<span class=\"br0\">[</span>i<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> equals <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">stride<span class=\"br0\">(</span>p<span class=\"br0\">[</span>i <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> extents<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">extent</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>p<span class=\"br0\">[</span>i <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> \n</li></ul>\n</dd><dd>for all <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i</span></code> in <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rank_</span></code><code>)</code></span>, where <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p<span class=\"br0\">[</span>i<span class=\"br0\">]</span></span></code> is the i<sup>th</sup> element of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>.\n</dd></dl>\n<p><small>(<a href=\"/w/cpp/container/mdspan/layout_stride/mapping#Member_constants\"><code><i>rank_</i></code></a> is an exposition-only static member constant defined in <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">layout_stride</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">mapping</span></span>.)</small>\n</p><p>See <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/LayoutMapping\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">LayoutMapping</em></a> for the semantics of these predicate mapping traits.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,3-4,6)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the mapping is exhaustive (see above)</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">5)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code></div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/mdspan","title":"std::mdspan"},{"path":"container/mdspan/layout_stride","title":"std::layout_stride"},{"path":"container/mdspan/layout_stride/mapping","title":"std::layout_stride::mapping"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::layout_stride::mapping<Extents>::mapping-traits","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"6 declarations; rev